sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Camera as OCR Camera
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Order as ORDER SERVICE
    participant Orchestrator as ORCHESTRATOR
    participant Payment as PAYMENT SERVICE
    participant Gas as GAS SERVICE
    participant Notification as NOTIFICATION
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Databases

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 1: Tạo Đơn Hàng

    Camera->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/orders<br/>{licensePlate, stationId, pumpId, fuelType}
    Gateway->>Order: Forward request

    Order->>Redis: GET vehicle:51F-123.45
    Redis-->>Order: Cache miss

    Order->>DB: SELECT * FROM vehicle<br/>WHERE license_plate = '51F-123.45'
    DB-->>Order: Vehicle data (ownerId: 123)

    Order->>Redis: SET vehicle:51F-123.45<br/>TTL 3600s

    Order->>DB: INSERT INTO fuel_order<br/>order_status = 'CREATED'
    DB-->>Order: order_id, order_code

    Order->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.order.created<br/>{orderCode, licensePlate, ownerId, ...}

    Order-->>Gateway: 201 Created<br/>{orderCode: "ORD20250101000001"}
    Gateway-->>Camera: Response

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 2: SAGA Orchestration

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.order.created

    Orchestrator->>DB: INSERT INTO saga_instances<br/>saga_id='SAGA001', saga_type='FUEL_PURCHASE', total_steps=8
    Orchestrator->>DB: INSERT INTO saga_step_logs<br/>saga_id='SAGA001', step_order=1, step_status='SUCCESS'

    Orchestrator->>Redis: SET saga:lock:ORD20250101000001<br/>EX 300 NX

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 1: CREATE_ORDER ✓<br/>Step 2: CHECK_BALANCE

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 2, action: "CHECK_BALANCE"}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 3: Kiểm Tra Số Dư

    Kafka-->>Payment: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Payment->>Redis: GET balance:owner:123
    Redis-->>Payment: Cache miss

    Payment->>DB: SELECT balance FROM owners<br/>WHERE id = 123
    DB-->>Payment: balance = 500000

    Payment->>Payment: Check: 500000 >= 50000 ✓

    Payment->>Redis: SET balance:owner:123 500000<br/>TTL 300s

    Payment->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 2, status: "SUCCESS"}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 4: Kích Hoạt Trụ Bơm

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=2, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 3

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 3: ACTIVATE_PUMP

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 3, action: "ACTIVATE_PUMP"}

    Kafka-->>Gas: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Gas->>Redis: HGET pump:status:PUMP001 status
    Redis-->>Gas: "AVAILABLE"

    Gas->>DB: UPDATE fuel_pumps<br/>SET pump_status = 'IN_USE'<br/>WHERE id = 1

    Gas->>DB: INSERT INTO pump_sessions<br/>session_status = 'STARTED'
    DB-->>Gas: session_code

    Gas->>Redis: HSET pump:status:PUMP001<br/>status "IN_USE"<br/>current_order "ORD20250101000001"

    Gas->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 3, status: "SUCCESS"}
    Gas->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.pump.activated<br/>{pumpId, sessionCode}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 5: Chờ Bơm Xăng

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=3, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 4

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 4: WAIT_PUMP_COMPLETE

    Note over IoT: Khách hàng bơm xăng...<br/>10.5 lít

    IoT->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/gas/pumps/1/complete<br/>{sessionCode, quantityLiters: 10.5}
    Gateway->>Gas: Forward request

    Gas->>Redis: HGET fuel:price:RON95 price
    Redis-->>Gas: 24500

    Gas->>Gas: Calculate: 10.5 * 24500 = 257,250 VNĐ

    Gas->>DB: UPDATE pump_sessions<br/>quantity_liters = 10.5<br/>total_amount = 257250<br/>session_status = 'COMPLETED'

    Gas->>DB: UPDATE fuel_pumps<br/>pump_status = 'AVAILABLE'

    Gas->>Redis: HSET pump:status:PUMP001<br/>status "AVAILABLE"<br/>current_order ""

    Gas->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.pump.completed<br/>{sessionCode, orderCode, quantity, amount}

    Gas-->>Gateway: 200 OK
    Gateway-->>IoT: Response

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 6: Xử Lý Thanh Toán

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.pump.completed

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=4, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 5

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 5: PROCESS_PAYMENT

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 5, action: "PROCESS_PAYMENT", amount: 257250}

    Kafka-->>Payment: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Payment->>Redis: SET payment:lock:owner:123<br/>ORD20250101000001 EX 30 NX
    Redis-->>Payment: OK (lock acquired)

    Payment->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Payment->>DB: SELECT balance FROM owners<br/>WHERE id = 123<br/>FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>Payment: balance = 500000

    Payment->>Payment: Check: 500000 >= 257250 ✓
    Payment->>Payment: New balance: 500000 - 257250 = 242750

    Payment->>DB: UPDATE owners<br/>SET balance = 242750<br/>WHERE id = 123

    Payment->>DB: INSERT INTO transactions<br/>kind = 'payment', status = 'SUCCESS'

    Payment->>DB: INSERT INTO payment_history<br/>amount = 257250, status = 'SUCCESS'

    Payment->>DB: COMMIT

    Payment->>Redis: SET balance:owner:123 242750<br/>TTL 300s

    Payment->>Redis: DEL payment:lock:owner:123

    Payment->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 5, status: "SUCCESS"}
    Payment->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.payment.success<br/>{transactionCode, orderCode, amount}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 7: Cập Nhật Tồn Kho

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=5, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 6

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 6: UPDATE_INVENTORY

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 6, action: "UPDATE_INVENTORY"}

    Kafka-->>Gas: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Gas->>DB: UPDATE fuel_inventory<br/>SET current_volume = current_volume - 10.5<br/>WHERE station_id = 1 AND fuel_type = 'RON95'

    Gas->>Redis: HSET inventory:station:1<br/>RON95 49989.5

    Gas->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 6, status: "SUCCESS"}
    Gas->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.inventory.updated<br/>{stationId, fuelType, newVolume}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 8: Hoàn Tất Đơn Hàng

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=6, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 7

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 7: COMPLETE_ORDER

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 7, action: "COMPLETE_ORDER"}

    Kafka-->>Order: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Order->>DB: UPDATE fuel_order<br/>SET order_status = 'COMPLETED'<br/>quantity_liters = 10.5<br/>total_amount = 257250

    Order->>Redis: HSET order:ORD20250101000001<br/>status "COMPLETED"

    Order->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 7, status: "SUCCESS"}
    Order->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.order.completed<br/>{orderCode, status}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 9: Gửi Thông Báo

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=7, step_status='SUCCESS'
    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>current_step = 8

    Note over Orchestrator: Step 8: SEND_NOTIFICATION

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.command<br/>{step: 8, action: "SEND_NOTIFICATION"}

    Kafka-->>Notification: Consume: fuel.saga.step.command

    Notification->>Redis: SADD notification:sent:ORD20250101000001<br/>"PAYMENT_SUCCESS"
    Redis-->>Notification: 1 (not duplicate)

    Notification->>Notification: Build message:<br/>"Thanh toan thanh cong 257,250d<br/>cho 10.5L RON95. So du: 242,750d"

    Notification->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications<br/>send_status = 'SENT'

    Notification->>Notification: Send SMS (mock)

    Notification->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.step.response<br/>{step: 8, status: "SUCCESS"}

    Note over Camera,DB: PHASE 10: Hoàn Tất SAGA

    Kafka-->>Orchestrator: Consume: fuel.saga.step.response

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_step_logs<br/>step_order=8, step_status='SUCCESS'

    Orchestrator->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances<br/>saga_status = 'COMPLETED'<br/>completed_at = NOW()

    Orchestrator->>Redis: DEL saga:lock:ORD20250101000001

    Orchestrator->>Kafka: Produce: fuel.saga.completed<br/>{sagaId, orderCode}

    Note over Camera,DB: ✓ HOÀN TẤT - Tổng thời gian: ~5 phút